<title>USA: Silicon Gaming wins final okay for Odyssey.</title>
<headline>Silicon Gaming wins final okay for Odyssey.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Gaming Inc on Wednesday said it has received final jurisdictional approval from the Nevada Gaming Commission to begin selling its advanced Odyssey slot machine.</p>
<p>Security Dynamics Technology Inc unit RSA Data Security Inc provided the secure encryption technology on which Odyssey's security was built, the company said.</p>
</text>
